[en.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CHANGELING]
Secret to Changelings

[en.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CHANGELING_desc]
Comparing to the ordinary centaurs, a greater risk of exposing our secret to Tirek is his allies —— the Equestria Empire and the Changelings.\nIt’s relatively easy to be cautious of the Empire, because this is the paradise for their officials to launder money and evade taxes. Besides some minor frictions over the naming of our ports, we don’t really have any conflict of interest with the Empire.\nBut the Changelings —— although we have barely contacted them, their black claws will reach out to the world, which is known to all creatures.\nOr... have they disguised themselves as Kirins and infiltrated our cities?

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CHANGELING]
对幻形灵的保密

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_SECRET_CHANGELING_desc]
相比于普通的半人马，更容易将我们的秘密暴露给提雷克的，是他的盟友 —— 小马利亚帝国与幻形灵。\n防范帝国还相对容易，因为这里是他们的官员洗钱、逃税的天堂，除了在港口命名上的一些小摩擦之外，我们与帝国的利益并没有太大的冲突。\n而幻形灵 —— 虽然我们基本没有接触过他们，但他们的黑爪会伸向世界，这是所有生物都知道的。\n又或者... 他们已经伪装成麒麟，潜伏在我们的城市中了？

